::ENG4_U04_L02_GP_Q01::[MLA.ENG4.RS.01] Research question: How do evening library hours affect adult learners? Source A gives attendance data. Source B gives an interview with one learner. Source C gives staffing cost information. Which source combination is strongest for an initial synthesis?
{
~A. Source B alone because personal stories are always enough.#Incorrect. This answer does not fully match the lesson skill or it misreads the evidence, research focus, or source information in the item.
=B. Sources A, B, and C together because they show demand, human impact, and feasibility.#Correct. This answer applies the lesson skill accurately and matches the evidence, research focus, or source information in the item.
~C. Source C alone because cost is the only issue.#Incorrect. This answer does not fully match the lesson skill or it misreads the evidence, research focus, or source information in the item.
~D. None of the sources because they are not identical.#Incorrect. This answer does not fully match the lesson skill or it misreads the evidence, research focus, or source information in the item.
}

